{I appeared for this game wearing a dinner-jacket and black elasticated bow
tie, determined to perish in style. Photographs taken during the game later
revealed that after Botvinnik's 26th move the elastic snapped, leaving my bow
tie dangling at an absurd angle, a fact of which I was oblivious during the
game - Keene} 1. Nf3 g6 2. c4 Bg7 3. d4 Nf6 4. g3 O-O 5. Bg2 c6 6. O-O d6 7.
Nc3 a6 8. a4 a5 9. b3 Na6 10. Ba3 Nb4 11. e4 Bg4 12. Qd2 Bxf3 13. Bxf3 Nd7 14.
