gives B-KN2 here)} Rfe8 18. d5 Nc5 19. Nc1 Rf8 20. Bb2 cxd5 21. cxd5 f5 22.
exf5 gxf5 23. Re1 Rc8 24. Bc3 Ne4 25. Bxe4 fxe4 26. Bxb4 Bh6 27. Qxh6 Qxf2+ 28.
Kh1 Qf3+ 29. Kg1 Qf2+ 30. Kh1 Rc2 31. Qh3 Qf3+ 32. Kg1 axb4 33. Ne2 Qe3+ 34.
Kh1 Rxe2 $4 (34... Rf2 $1 $11) 35. Qg4+ {Sources: CHESS, February 1967, Vol.32/
521-2, p128; Keene's Best Games (HS 2002)} 1-0

